--------------------------------------------------------------------------
vanilla-mcdoc (MIT)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The density function schema in lib/src/density_schema.inc and
lib/include/stratum/density/node_types.inc is generated by tools/mcdoc-sync
from the mcdoc schema definitions published by SpyglassMC at
https://github.com/SpyglassMC/vanilla-mcdoc, under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2022 SpyglassMC.

The schema is fetched at a pinned commit and never vendored: this
repository ships the tool and the generated tables, not the upstream
source tree. SPEC section 11 requires the schema be derived rather than
hand-written, so that a field name cannot drift from what the format
actually specifies.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
xoroshiro128++ (public domain)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/include/stratum/rng/xoroshiro128.hpp reimplements the xoroshiro128++
generator by David Blackman and Sebastiano Vigna, published at
https://prng.di.unimi.it/xoroshiro128plusplus.c and dedicated to the public
domain. No attribution is required; it is recorded here because this
repository records every outside reference it builds on.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
zlib (linked dependency)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Region files store chunks deflated, so the engine links zlib
(https://zlib.net/), by Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler, under the zlib
license. It is used as a dependency, not vendored: a system zlib is
preferred, and one is fetched and built only when the platform has none.

