fdlibm (SunPro)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/src/fdlibm_log.cpp is adapted from fdlibm 5.3, file e_log.c
(version 1.3, 95/01/18), obtained from https://www.netlib.org/fdlibm/.
It carries the upstream notice in its file header, reproduced here:

    ====================================================
